ilitary career in the light infantry--consisting of dangerous duty that demanded constant vigilance--followed by service as an orderly to a general at West Point. Young also examines her postwar life as a wife and mother on a hardscrabble farm in Massachusetts, her collaboration on the book that made her a celebrity and sent her on a yearlong lecture tour through New England and New York in 1802-03, and her relentless and partially successful quest for veterans' benefits.--From publisher description.","subjectCategories":[{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Biography","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Female Participation","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"History","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Participation, Female","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Soldiers","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Women soldiers","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},{"source":"open_library","scheme":"open_library_subject","label":"Gannett, deborah sampson, 1760-1827","sourceId":"source-open-library-summary-masquerade-the-life-and-times-of-deborah-sampson-continental-soldier-alfred-f-young"},